                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The minimum income necessary for a worker to meet their basic needs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae290bae-5a9c-4eb6-91ef-5f9f985e217c",
                                                "sense_id": "08e4c856-83c1-3ddb-8391-7823cfa72640",
                                                "text": "The RMT union is claiming a \"massive victory\" after outsourcing company Mitie agreed to pay the living wage to employees working at Network Rail stations. It follows a campaign by the union to improve pay, with RMT General Secretary Mick Cash commenting: \"This is a massive victory in the fight to eliminate the evil of low pay on the railway, [...].\""
                                            }
